<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 768 MLN OF 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 768 MLN OF 91-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 768 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 768 million zlotys, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield remained flat at 23.50.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
